												</div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;border-left:0pt solid #000000;border-right:0pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">(1)&#160;&#160;&#160;</span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Fuel-burning Equipment for Each Unit</span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">. The fee should be based upon the maximum designed heat input capacity,</span></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;border-left:0pt solid #000000;border-right:0pt solid #000000;"><div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;border-left:0pt solid #000000;border-right:0pt solid #000000;"><div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;border-left:0pt solid #000000;border-right:0pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">&#160;&#160;&#160;A.&#160;&#160;&#160;Of a heat input capacity of less than 2,500,000 BTU/HR</span></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:0pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0pt solid #000000;border-left:0pt solid #000000;border-right:0pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inlin