-size:9pt;">Lot Dimensions</span></div></div></td><td colspan="3" style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">No min</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">(2) </span><span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Setbacks</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Where applicable</span></div></div></td><td colspan="3" style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Requirements</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="4" style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">A. Front Yard Depth </span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">1</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Primary</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Min: 20' or, if greater, the average setback of the buildings within 100' on both sides.<br></br>Max: none</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Min: 10'<br></br>Max: 20'</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Min: 0'<br></br>Max: 12'</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Secondary</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Min: 7'</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Min: 5'</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Min: none</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Interior</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Min: 10'</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><div style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:9pt;">Min: 8'</span></div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022i