												Wall
												
												
											</div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div class="Table-Header">
												
												Window
												
												
											</div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div class="Table-Header">
												
												Canopy
												
												
											</div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div class="Table-Header"><span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Roof</span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">&#160;</span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;">2</span></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Identification or Business </span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;">2, 3</span></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">#: 1 per lot </span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;">4</span></div></td><td colspan="2" style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">SF: As regulated by formula</span></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">#: 1 per building unit</span></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">#: 1 per building unit</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">SF: 50 </span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align: super;display: inline;">1</span></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">SF: 6 if hanging from soffit</span></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Ht: 25 ft.</span></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Ht: permitted building height</span></div></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="3" style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-rig