												Fee
												
												
											</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="xsl-table xsl-table--body"><table cellSpacing="0" style="width: &#10;                  700px&#10;                ;"><colgroup><col width="41.143%&#10;              "></col><col width="41.143%&#10;              "></col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div class="Table-Header">Category
												
												
