v id="rid-0-0-0-17307" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-17307"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-17538', hash: '#JD_385.27' }}">385.27</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Marking of Doors</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-17308" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-17308"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-17541', hash: '#JD_385.28' }}">385.28</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Acetylene Manufacturing for Sale</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-17309" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-17309"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-17545', hash: '#JD_385.29' }}">385.29</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Conformity to Recognized Standards</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-17310" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-17310"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn-center">Combustible and Explosive Dusts</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-17311" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-17311"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-17550', hash: '#JD_385.30' }}">385.30</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Scope and Application of Provisions; Technical Standards</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-17312" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-17312"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-17554', hash: '#JD_385.31' }}">385.31</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;General Requirements for Buildings</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-17313" class="rbox Normal-Level"