o withstand a wind pressure of not less than thirty (30) pounds per square foot.</span></div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><div id="rid-0-0-0-20793" class="rbox Chapter"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-20793"></AnnotationDrawer><h4><a name="JD_Chapter3131" id="JD_Chapter3131" title="Chapter 3131"></a>CHAPTER 3131 &#8211; HEATING, VENTILATING AND AIR CONDITIONING</h4></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-20794" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-20794"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-20812', hash: '#JD_3131.01' }}">3131.01</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Permit Required</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-20795" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-20795"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-20816', hash: '#JD_3131.02' }}">3131.02</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Approval of Commissioner of Air Pollution Control</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-20796" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-20796"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-20818', hash: '#JD_3131.03' }}">3131.03</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Use and Maintenance of Existing Flues and Gas Vents</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-20797" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-20797"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-20822', hash: '#JD_3131.04' }}">3131.04</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Required Temperatures for Heating Systems</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-20798" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-20798"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-20827', hash: '#JD_3131.05' }}">3131.05</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Approval of Devic