ump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-22764', hash: '#JD_431.11' }}">431.11</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Turning into Private Driveway, Alley or Building</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-22663" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-22663"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-22771', hash: '#JD_431.12' }}">431.12</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#8220;U&#8221; Turns Restricted</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-22664" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-22664"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-22777', hash: '#JD_431.13' }}">431.13</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Starting and Backing Vehicles</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-22665" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-22665"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-22782', hash: '#JD_431.14' }}">431.14</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Signals Before Changing Course, Turning or Stopping</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-22666" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-22666"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-22789', hash: '#JD_431.15' }}">431.15</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Hand and Arm Signals</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-22667" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-22667"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-49316', hash: '#JD_431.16' }}">431.16</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Right-of-Way at Intersections</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-22668" class="rbox Normal-Level"><