iv class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-24735" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-24735"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-24849', hash: '#JD_459.12' }}">459.12</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Motor Vehicle Registration Hold Due to Nonpayment of Parking Infraction Judgments</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-24736" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-24736" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-24736"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_459.01" id="JD_459.01" title="459.01"></a>&#167; 459.01  Definitions</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-24737" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-24737"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;The following words and phrases, when used in this chapter of the Traffic Code, shall have the meanings respectively ascribed to them by this section.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-24738" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-24738"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;(a)&#160;&#160;&#160;&#8220;Parking Infraction&#8221; means a violation of the following sections of the Codified Ordinances of Cleveland, Ohio, 1976:</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-24739" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-24739"></AnnotationDrawer><div><ScrollTable><div class="xsl-table xsl-table--empty xsl-table--header"><table cellSpacing="0" style="width: &#10;                  700px&#10;                ;"><colgroup><col width="11.81%&#10;              "></col><col width="36.571%&#10;              "></col></colgroup><tbody></tbody></table></div><div class="xsl-table xsl-table--body"><table cellSpacing="0" style="width: &#10;                  700px&#10;                ;"><colgroup><col width="11.81%&#10;              "></col><col width="36.571%&#10;              "></col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-8669', hash: '#JD_203.08' }}">203.08</Link></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div>Parking Waste Collection Vehicles</div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-14019', hash: '#JD_343.20' }}">343.20</Link></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div>Service Station Parking Restrictions</div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-22135', hash: '#JD_405.023' }}">405.023</Link></div></td><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div>Continuous Violation Tickets</div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleve