olid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Theresa Ct. N.E., from E. 3rd St. to E. 9th St.</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">&#160;&#160;&#160;W. 2nd St., from Public Square to St. Clair Ave. N.E.</span></div></td></tr><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">&#160;&#160;&#160;E. 4th St. from St. Clair Ave. N.E. to Lakeside Ave. N.E.</span></div></td></tr></tbody><tfoot><tr><td></td></tr></tfoot></table></div></ScrollTable></div><div style="margin-bottom=10pt">&#160;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27076" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27076" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27076"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.02" id="JD_521.02" title="521.02"></a>&#167; 521.02  Provisions for Removal of Wires</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27077" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27077"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Every person, firm or corporation now or hereafter owning or operating any wires, cables or poles used for supporting the same, located on or above the surface of any streets, alleys or public grounds in the City hereafter enumerated as Schedule B, shall remove or cause to be removed, from above the surface of any of the streets, alleys or public grounds, or parts thereof, all such cables, wires and poles used for supporting the same, to the extent of at least ten (10) miles, street measurement, for each such person, firm or corporation, during the remainder of the year 1914, and to the extent of at least fourteen (14) miles, street measurement, for each such person, firm or corporation, during each and every calendar year thereafter, beginning with January 1, 1915. This shall not be held to apply, however, to arc lights used for street lighting, or to the poles and wires for the same, or to trolley and feed wires used for street cars, or to the poles supporting the same.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27078" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27078" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27078"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.03" id="JD_521.03" title="521.03"></a>&#167; 521.03  Submission of Plans for Removal of Wires</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27079" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27079"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Every such person, firm or corporation shall, during the month of October of each year, submit a plan and schedule to the Director of Public Service, showing the particular territory within which the person, firm or corporation proposes to remove or place underground during the following calendar year its wires, cables and poles for supporting the same, to the extent of fourteen (14) miles, street measurement.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27080" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27080"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Every such person, firm or corporation shall also, during the first thirty (30) days after this chapter becomes effective, submit a plan and schedule to the Director showing the particular territory within which the person, firm or corporation proposes to remove or place underground during the remainder of the year 1914, its wires, cables and poles for supporting the same, to the extent of ten (10) miles, street measurement.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27081" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27081" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27081"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.04" id="JD_521.04" title="521.04"></a>&#167; 521.04  Director of Public Service May Change Plans</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27082" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27082"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;The Director of Public Service shall have the right to change the schedules and plans submitted, or to substitute therefor other schedules and plans, designating the territory for each person, firm or corporation within which its wires, cables and poles for supporting the same shall be removed or placed underground. No such plan or schedule shall be changed, however, to include any street, alley or public ground not enumerated herein as a part of <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27083', hash: '#JD_ScheduleB' }}">Schedule B</Link>.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27083" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27083" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27083"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.05" id="JD_521.05" title="521.05"></a>&#167; 521.05  Final Plans Returned by Director</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27084" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27084"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;The Director of Public Service shall, during the month of November of each year, return to the several persons, firms or corporations the plans and schedules submitted, with such changes or substitutions as he or she has seen fit to make, and with his or her approval, and such plans and schedules as approved and returned, shall be binding upon the several persons, firms or corporations. Each such person, firm or corporation shall during the following calendar year remove its wires, cables and poles for supporting the same in accordance with the schedule and plan approved and returned by the Director. The schedules and plans for the remainder of the year 1914, however, shall be returned by the Director within forty (40) days after this chapter takes effect, and these schedules and plans as approved and returned by the Director, shall be binding upon the several aforesaid persons, firms or corporations, who shall during the remainder of the year 1914 proceed to remove or place underground their wires, cables and poles in accordance therewith, to the extent of ten (10) miles, street measurement.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27085" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27085"></AnnotationDrawer><div><ScrollTable><div class="xsl-table xsl-table--header"><table cellSpacing="0" style="width: &#10;                  700px&#10;                ;"><colgroup><col width="65.714%&#10;              "></col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div class="Table-Header"><a name="JD_ScheduleB" id="JD_ScheduleB" title="Schedule B"></a>Schedule B
												
											</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="xsl-table xsl-table--body"><table cellSpacing="0" style="width: &#10;                  700px&#10;                ;"><colgroup><col width="65.714%&#10;              "></col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;"><div class="Table-Header"><a name="JD_ScheduleB" id="JD_ScheduleB" title="Schedule B"></a>Schedule B
												
