<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27086" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27086" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27086"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.06" id="JD_521.06" title="521.06"></a>&#167; 521.06  Alternate Placement of Wires and Cables</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27087" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27087"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Whenever the placing of the wires and cables underground as referred to in Sections <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27076', hash: '#JD_521.02' }}">521.02</Link> to <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27083', hash: '#JD_521.05' }}">521.05</Link> would necessitate the tearing up of the pavement in any street then in good condition and where there is not sufficient room between the curb and the sidewalk for the laying of the necessary conduits underground, then if such wires and cables are suspended from poles following the rear lot lines of the lots bounding and abutting upon the street from which such wires are so removed, when such work has been done and the wires, cables and poles removed from the street, then the same shall be deemed a satisfactory substitute for the literal compliance with the requirement of Sections <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27076', hash: '#JD_521.02' }}">521.02</Link> to <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27083', hash: '#JD_521.05' }}">521.05</Link>. The parties so complying with the provisions of this section shall thereby be relieved from further obligation to comply with the abovementioned sections in so far as the same relate to that portion of the street from which the wires, cables and poles have been removed.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27088" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27088"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 75427. Passed 8-16-26)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27089" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27089" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27089"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.07" id="JD_521.07" title="521.07"></a>&#167; 521.07  Excess Removal of Wires May Apply on Next Year&#8217;s Quota</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27090" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27090"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Whenever in any one (1) calendar year any person, firm or corporation shall remove or place underground wires, cables and poles in excess of the fourteen (14) miles, street measurement, required by this chapter, the amount in excess, or any part thereof, if removed or placed underground with the approval of the Director of Public Service, shall in any subsequent calendar year that the person, firm or corporation may elect, be counted a part of the fourteen (14) miles, street measurement, of wires, cables and poles required by this chapter to be placed underground or removed in that year.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27091" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27091" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27091"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.08" id="JD_521.08" title="521.08"></a>&#167; 521.08  Credit for Joint Removal of Wires</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27092" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27092"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;When two (2) or more persons, firms or corporations own jointly any wires, cables or poles, and place underground or remove the same in accordance with a plan and schedule approved by the Director of Public Service, each person, firm or corporation shall be credited with the amount so removed.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27093" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27093" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27093"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.09" id="JD_521.09" title="521.09"></a>&#167; 521.09  Procedure when Streets of Schedule B Become Part of Schedule A</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27094" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27094"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;When all the wires, cables and poles, except trolley and feed wires used for street cars, and the poles supporting the same, and arc lights used for street lighting and the poles and wires for the same, and such distributing poles as the Director of Public Service has approved, have been removed from above the surface of any of the streets, alleys or public grounds of the City, enumerated in Schedule B, in accordance with plans and schedules approved by the Director, all such streets, alleys or public grounds, or parts thereof, shall thereupon automatically become a part of Schedule A, and shall be subject to the provisions of this chapter governing the same.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27095" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27095" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27095"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.10" id="JD_521.10" title="521.10"></a>&#167; 521.10  Underground Wiring Required in New Subdivisions</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27096" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27096"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;In new subdivisions of ten (10) or more lots, all telephone, electric power and street lighting wires, conduits or cables to serve lots in such subdivision shall be constructed underground upon easements provided for the utilities, except that those wires, conduits or cables owned by or serving individual customers and located wholly on the customer&#8217;s property, need not be located upon easements. All underground wiring shall be constructed in accordance with standards and regulations promulgated by the Public Utilities Commission of Ohio.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27097" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27097"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;No such subdivision shall be approved by the Platting Commissioner nor shall any permit be issued by the Commissioner of Building for the construction of any building within a subdivision unless proper provision has been made to comply with the requirements of this section.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27098" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27098"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 1287-66. Passed 6-27-66, eff. 6-30-66)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-27099" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-27099" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27099"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_521.99" id="JD_521.99" title="521.99"></a>&#167; 521.99  Penalty</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27100" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27100"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Any person, firm or corporation which violates or fails to comply with any of the provisions of this chapter shall be fined not less than one hundred dollars ($100.00) nor more than five hundred dollars ($500.00) and the costs of the prosecution. A separate offense shall be deemed committed each day during or on which an offense occurs or continues.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27101" class="rbox Chapter"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27101"></AnnotationDrawer><h4><a name="JD_Chapter523" id="JD_Chapter523" title="Chapter 523"></a>CHAPTER 523 &#8211; RULES AND RATES</h4></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27102" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27102"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27143', hash: '#JD_523.01' }}">523.01</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Provisions for Sale of Electricity</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27103" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27103"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27146', hash: '#JD_523.02' }}">523.02</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Residential Rate Schedule</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27104" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27104"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-49951', hash: '#JD_523.021' }}">523.021</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Residential Incentive Rate Schedule &#8211; Repealed</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27105" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27105"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27163', hash: '#JD_523.03' }}">523.03</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Small Commercial Rate Schedule</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27106" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27106"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27176', hash: '#JD_523.04' }}">523.04</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Large Commercial Rate Schedules</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div