 class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-52787', hash: '#JD_523.067' }}">523.067</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Small Wireless Facility Rate Schedule</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27116" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27116"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27344', hash: '#JD_523.07' }}">523.07</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Regulations for Applicants for Electrical Service</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27117" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27117"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27363', hash: '#JD_523.08' }}">523.08</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Provisions Governing Advance Deposits</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27118" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27118"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27370', hash: '#JD_523.09' }}">523.09</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Accounting System</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27119" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27119"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27373', hash: '#JD_523.10' }}">523.10</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Statements for Service Supplied</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27120" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27120"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27378', hash: '#JD_523.11' }}">523.11</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Delinquent Accounts</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49952" class="rbox No