></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27532" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27532"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27667', hash: '#JD_531.17' }}">531.17</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Backfilling Regulations</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27533" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27533"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27670', hash: '#JD_531.18' }}">531.18</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Regulations for Stop Cocks or Valves and Boxes</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27534" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27534"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27673', hash: '#JD_531.19' }}">531.19</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Temporary Service Connections; Deposit</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27535" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27535"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27676', hash: '#JD_531.20' }}">531.20</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Extension on Stop Cocks</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27536" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27536"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27679', hash: '#JD_531.21' }}">531.21</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Stop Cock or Valve Boxes in Flagging or Pavements</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27537" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27537"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27682', hash: '#JD_531.22' }}">531.22</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Regulations for Compression Stop and Waste Cocks and Valves; Space for Meter</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27538" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27538"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27685', hash: '#JD_531.23' }}">531.23</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Backflow Prevention Control Device Required</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27539" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27539"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27693', hash: '#JD_531.24' }}">531.24</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Qualification and Certification of Persons to Inspect and Maintain Backflow Prevention Devices</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27540" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27540"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27702', hash: '#JD_531.25' }}">531.25</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Two or More Services for One Premises; Connecting Pipe Specifications</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27541" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27541"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27706', hash: '#JD_531.26' }}">531.26</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Applications or Changes in Fire Service Connections</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-27542" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-27542"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-27712', hash: '#JD_531.27' }}">531.27</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Plans and Information to be Furnished for Fire Service Connections<