-0-0-29341" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29341"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29710', hash: '#JD_559.41' }}">559.41</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Disturbing Animals or Wildlife</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29342" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29342"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29713', hash: '#JD_559.42' }}">559.42</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Boats, etc., in Watercourses</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29343" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29343"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29715', hash: '#JD_559.43' }}">559.43</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Boat Service; Skating</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29344" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29344"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29718', hash: '#JD_559.44' }}">559.44</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Going onto Ice</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29345" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29345"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29721', hash: '#JD_559.45' }}">559.45</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Behavior in Parks</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29346" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29346"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29723', hash: '#JD_559.46' }}">559.46</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Use or Sale of Intoxicating Liquor</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29347" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29347"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29726', hash: '#JD_559.47' }}">559.47</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Entering &#8220;No Admittance&#8221; Areas</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29348" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29348"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29728', hash: '#JD_559.48' }}">559.48</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Swings and Hammocks</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29349" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29349"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29730', hash: '#JD_559.49' }}">559.49</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Fishing, Wading or Swimming</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29350" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29350"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29732', hash: '#JD_559.50' }}">559.50</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Sounding Whistles</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29351" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29351"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29734', hash: '#JD_559.51' }}">559.51</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Defacing Notices of Rules</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29352" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29352"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29736', hash: '#JD_559.52' }}">559.52</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Hours; Posting of Signs</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29353" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29353"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29740', hash: '#JD_559.53' }}">559.53</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Trespass on City Facilities</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29354" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29354"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29745', hash: '#JD_559.54' }}">559.54</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Prohibited Hours in the Mall Area</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29355" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29355"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29754', hash: '#JD_559.541' }}">559.541</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Prohibited Hours in Public Square</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29356" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29356"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29764', hash: '#JD_559.55' }}">559.55</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Resisting Police</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29357" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29357"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29766', hash: '#JD_559.56' }}">559.56</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Exhibiting Permits for Inspection</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29358" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29358"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29768', hash: '#JD_559.57' }}">559.57</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Limitations on Permits; Liability of Holders</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29359" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29359"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29770', hash: '#JD_559.58' }}">559.58</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Regulations Governing Bicycles and Tricycles</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29360" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29360"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29780', hash: '#JD_559.59' }}">559.59</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Motor Vehicles</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29361" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29361"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29782', hash: '#JD_559.60' }}">559.60</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Restrictions on Driving and Parking</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29362" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29362"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29786', hash: '#JD_559.61' }}">559.61</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Jim Mahon Park</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29363" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29363"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="ChapAn"><Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29794', hash: '#JD_559.99' }}">559.99</Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Penalty<br></br></div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29364" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29364"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="paragraph-Note">&#160;&#160;&#160;Note: The legislative history of this chapter, except where specifically noted at the end of a section, is as follows: Ordinance No. 63410-A, passed September 22, 1924.<br></br></div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29368" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29368"></AnnotationDrawer><div><span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Cross-reference:<br></br></span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">&#160;&#160;&#160;Destruction of shrubs, trees and crops, CO <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-33480', hash: '#JD_623.06' }}">623.06<br></br></Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Littering in parks, CO <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-32520', hash: '#JD_613.08' }}">613.08<br></br></Link>&#160;&#160;&#160;Tree injury and destruction prohibited, CO <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-26233', hash: '#JD_509.01' }}">509.01</Link> et seq.</span></div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29376" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29376"></AnnotationDrawer><div><span style="font-weight: bold;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Statutory reference:<br></br></span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">&#160;&#160;&#160;Assessments for tree planting or maintenance, RC 727.011<br></br>&#160;&#160;&#160;Establishment and extension, RC 755.08<br></br>&#160;&#160;&#160;Land appropriation for parks, RC 715.21, 719.01<br></br>&#160;&#160;&#160;Municipal parks, RC 715.21, 755.01 et seq.<br></br>&#160;&#160;&#160;Power to regulate shade trees and shrubbery, RC 715.20<br></br>&#160;&#160;&#160;Power to regulate vehicle speed, RC 4511.07<br></br>&#160;&#160;&#160;Supervision and maintenance of recreational facilities, RC 755.13</span></div></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29377" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29377" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29377"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.01" id="JD_559.01" title="559.01"></a>&#167; 559.01  Use of Parks</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29378" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29378"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;The parks are constructed and maintained for the use of the public at large, and shall be opened daily to all citizens on absolutely equal terms and none shall be given special privileges therein, or be permitted to make use of them for any purpose not practically common to all and not in consonance with the proper use of the park.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29379" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29379"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;To that end no person shall have or give any musical, theatrical or other entertainment nor shall any military society or other parade, procession, public gathering or meeting of any kind, take place in any of the parks. No person shall in any of the parks or in any refectory, restaurant, building or place on the same, solicit fares, or beg or publicly solicit subscriptions or make any oration, harangue, demonstration or address; nor shall the speakers&#8217; stand be used, except upon the written permission of the Director of Public Properties.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29380" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29380" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29380"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.02" id="JD_559.02" title="559.02"></a>&#167; 559.02  Designation of Cleveland Cultural Gardens</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29386" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29386"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;In view of the improvements installed and now existing in Rockefeller Parkway, and with the view to perpetuating the sentimental and historical association established;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-40152" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-40152"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Situated in the City of Cleveland, County of Cuyahoga and State of Ohio and known as being part of Original 100 Acre Lot Nos. 376, 375, 367, 377, 384 and 385 of East Cleveland Township, and bounded and described as follows:</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-40151" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-40151"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;All that portion of Rockefeller Park lying between Wade Park, N. E., on the south, the New York Central Lines, LLC, on the north, except that portion of St. Clair Ave. N. E. and Superior Avenue, N.E. lying within these bounds, shall be designated Cleveland Cultural Gardens. Be the same more or less subject to all legal highways and easements of record.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-40150" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-40150"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Cleveland Cultural Gardens shall be subdivided into units, bounded and described in the following sections.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-40153" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-40153"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 1327-12. Passed 12-3-12, eff. 12-6-12)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29387" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29387" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29387"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.03" id="JD_559.03" title="559.03"></a>&#167; 559.03  Polish Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29388" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29388"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at a point in the westerly line of the upper drive at its point of intersection with the westerly prolongation of the center line of Maury Ave.; thence northerly along the westerly line of the upper drive about 149.00 feet to an iron pipe in the northeasterly corner of the Jugoslav Garden which is the principal place of beginning; thence westerly along the northerly line of the Jugoslav Garden 419.07 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of lower drive 176.90 feet to the southerly line of St. Clair Ave.; thence easterly along the southerly line of St Clair Ave. 395.80 feet, to the westerly line of the upper drive; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 278.60 feet to the principal place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29389" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29389"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29390" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29390" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29390"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.04" id="JD_559.04" title="559.04"></a>&#167; 559.04  Slovenian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29391" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29391"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at a point in the westerly line of the upper drive at its point of intersection with the westerly prolongation of the center line of Maury Ave.; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 108.22 feet to an iron pipe which is also the northeasterly corner of the Czech Garden; thence westerly along the northerly line of the Czech Garden 393.15 feet, to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 120.35 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the Polish Garden; thence easterly along the southerly line of the Polish Garden 419.07 feet to an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive about 149.00 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29392" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29392"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 811-95. Passed 6-19-95, eff. 6-28-95)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29393" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29393"></AnnotationDrawer><div class="paragraph-Note">&#160;&#160;&#160;Note: Pursuant to Ord. No. 811-95, passed 6-19-95, effective 6-28-95, the &#8220;Jugoslav Garden&#8221; was renamed the &#8220;Slovenian Garden.&#8221;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29394" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29394" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29394"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.05" id="JD_559.05" title="559.05"></a>&#167; 559.05  Czech Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29395" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29395"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive, which is also the southeasterly corner of the Jugoslav Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 272.00 feet to an iron pipe in the northeasterly corner of the Rusin Garden; thence westerly along the northerly line of the Rusin Garden 346.20 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 471.90 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the Jugoslav Garden; thence westerly along the southerly line of the Jugoslav Garden 393.15 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29396" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29396"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29397" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29397" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29397"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.06" id="JD_559.06" title="559.06"></a>&#167; 559.06  Rusin Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29398" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29398"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive which is also the southeasterly corner of the Czech Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 341.00 feet to an iron pipe in the northeasterly corner of the Slovak Garden; thence westerly along the northerly line of the Slovak Garden 389.53 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 349.10 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the Czech Garden; thence easterly along the southerly line of the Czech Garden 346.20 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29399" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29399"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29400" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29400" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29400"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.07" id="JD_559.07" title="559.07"></a>&#167; 559.07  Slovak Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29401" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29401"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive which is also the southeasterly corner of the Rusin Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 552.40 feet to an iron pipe in the northerly line of the park drive (known as Pollock Hill) connecting the upper and lower drives; thence westerly along the northerly line of the so-called connecting drive to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 417.10 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the Rusin Garden; thence easterly along the southerly line of the Rusin Garden 389.53 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29402" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29402"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29403" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29403" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29403"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.08" id="JD_559.08" title="559.08"></a>&#167; 559.08  Italian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29404" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29404"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at a stone monument in the easterly line of the upper drive in Rockefeller Park at its intersection with the center line of Parkgate Ave., N.E.; thence westerly along the prolongation of the center line of Parkgate Ave., N.E., 40.85 feet to a point; thence on a line deflecting to the left 92 degrees 26 minutes 40 seconds 87.83 feet to an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive which is the principal place of beginning; thence southerly along the arc of a circle whose chord deflects to the left 1 degree 16 minutes 00 seconds 50.00 feet to an iron pipe, said arc having a radius of 786.03 feet, and a chord which measures 50 feet; thence on a line deflecting to the right from the chord of said arc produced 82 degrees 25 minutes 00 seconds 307.35 feet, to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive in said park; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 95.90 feet to an iron pipe in the southerly line of a 20 foot drive connecting the upper and lower drives in said park (said drive being opposite the westerly end of Parkgate Ave., N.E., and being commonly known as Pollock Hill); thence continuing along the southerly side of said 20 foot drive to an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive; thence southerly along said westerly line 53.08 feet to the principal place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29405" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29405"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29406" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29406" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29406"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.09" id="JD_559.09" title="559.09"></a>&#167; 559.09  Grecian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29407" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29407"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive which point is also the southeasterly corner of the Italian Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 165.90 feet to an iron pipe in the northeasterly corner of the Lithuanian Garden; thence westerly along the northerly line of the Lithuanian Garden 223.55 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 262.30 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the Italian Garden; thence easterly along the southerly line of the Italian Garden 307.35 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29408" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29408"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29409" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29409" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29409"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.10" id="JD_559.10" title="559.10"></a>&#167; 559.10  Lithuanian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29410" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29410"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive, which is also the southeasterly corner of the Grecian Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 218.00 feet to an iron pipe in the northeasterly corner of the German Garden; thence westerly along the northerly line of the German Garden 225.26 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 201.90 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the Grecian Garden; thence easterly along the southerly line of the Grecian Garden 223.55 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29411" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29411"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29412" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29412" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29412"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.11" id="JD_559.11" title="559.11"></a>&#167; 559.11  German Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29414" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29414"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Commencing at a 3/4" Iron Pipe Found on the Northeast Line of Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard at the Southwest Corner of the Lithuanian Cultural Garden, also being the Northwest Corner of the German Cultural Garden, said point being the point of beginning;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49220" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49220"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence N 61&#176;52'46" E, along the southerly line of said Lithuanian Cultural Garden a distance of 224.39 feet, to a point on the Southwest line of East Boulevard (80 feet wide), also being the Southeast Corner of the said Lithuanian Cultural Garden and the Northeast Corner of said German Cultural Garden;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49219" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49219"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence Southeasterly along said Southwest line of East Boulevard, 261.51 feet on a curve deflecting to the left, having a radius of 786.03 feet, a central angle of 19&#176;03'45", and a chord bearing S 44&#176;02'24" E 260.31 feet to the point of reverse curvature;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49218" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49218"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence continuing Southeasterly along said Southwest line of East Boulevard, 241.29 feet, along said reverse curve deflecting to the right having a radius of 848.60 feet, a central angle of 16&#176;17'29" and a chord bearing S 45&#176;25'32" E, 240.48 feet to the Northeast Corner of the Hungarian Cultural Garden also being Southeast Corner of said German Cultural Garden;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49217" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49217"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence S 61&#176;51'55" W, along the Northeast line of said Hungarian Cultural Garden, also being the Southwest line of said German Cultural Garden, a distance of 211.49 feet to the Southeast Corner of Centennial Plaza;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49216" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49216"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence along the Northeasterly and Northwesterly lines of said Centennial Plaza the following 7 courses;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49215" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49215"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence N 28&#176;08'05" W, a distance of 117.05 feet to the point of curvature of a non-tangent curve;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49214" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49214"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence Northwesterly 22.12 feet, along said non-tangent curve deflecting to the right, having a radius of 72.50 feet, a central angle of 17&#176;28'43" and a chord bearing N 69&#176;44'21" W, 22.03 feet to a point;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49213" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49213"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence N 61&#176;00'00" W, a distance of 22.50 feet to the point of curvature of a tangent curve;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49212" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49212"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence 56.01 feet along said curve deflecting to the left, having a radius of 55.00 feet, a central angle of 58&#176;21'00" and a chord bearing S 89&#176;49'30" W, 53.62 feet to a point of tangency;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49211" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49211"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence S 60&#176;39'00" W, a distance of 18.50 feet to the point of curvature of a tangent curve;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49210" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49210"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence 35.87 feet along said curve deflecting to the right, having a radius of 35.50 feet, a central angle of 57&#176;53'41" and a chord bearing S 89&#176;35'51"W, 34.36 feet to a point;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49209" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49209"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence S 61&#176;51'55" W, a distance of 39.00 feet to a point on said Northeast Line of Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49208" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49208"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence Northwesterly along said Northeast Line of Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard 287.07 feet, along a non-tangent curve deflecting to the right, having a radius of 2530.00 feet, a central angle of 06&#176;30'04" and a chord bearing N 26&#176;51'19" W, 286.92 feet to the point of beginning, said described tract containing 2.6553 Acres (115,663 Square Feet).</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49198" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49198"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 859-2019. Passed 7-24-19, eff. 7-26-19)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-49197" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-49197" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49197"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.111" id="JD_559.111" title="559.111"></a>&#167; 559.111  Centennial Peace Plaza</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49194" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49194"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Commencing at a 3/4" Iron Pipe Found on the Northeast Line of Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard at the Southwest Corner of the Lithuanian Cultural Garden, also being the Northwest Corner of the German Cultural Garden, thence Southeasterly along said Northeast line of  Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard, 287.07 feet, along a curve deflecting to the left, having a radius 2530.00 feet, a central angle of 06&#176;30'04" and a chord bearing N 26&#176;51'19" W, 286.92 feet, to the place of beginning;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49207" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49207"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence N 61&#176;51'55" E, a distance of 39.00 feet to a point;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49206" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49206"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence Northeasterly 35.87 feet, along a curve deflecting to the left, having a radius of 35.50 feet, a central angle of 57&#176;53'41" and a chord bearing N 89&#176;35'51" E, 34.36 feet to a point of tangency;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49205" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49205"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence N 60&#176;39'00" E, a distance of 18.50 feet to a point of curvature;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49204" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49204"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence Northeasterly 56.01 feet, along a curve deflecting to the right, having a radius of 55.00 feet, a central angle of 58&#176;21'00" and a chord bearing N 89&#176;49'30" E, 53.62 feet to a point of tangency;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49203" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49203"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence S 61&#176;00'00" E, a distance of 22.50 feet to a point of curvature;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49202" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49202"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence  Southeasterly 22.12 feet, along a curve deflecting to the left, having a radius of 72.50 feet, a central angle of 17&#176;28'43" and a chord bearing S 69&#176;44'21" E, 22.03 feet;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49201" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49201"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence S 28&#176;08'05" E, a distance of 117.05 feet, to a point on the Northwest Line of the Hungarian Cultural Garden;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49200" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49200"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence S 61&#176;51'55" W, along said Northwest Line of the Hungarian Cultural Garden, a distance of 148.05 feet, to a point on the aforesaid Northeast Line of Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49199" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49199"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence Northwesterly along said Northeast Line of Martin Luther King Jr. Boulevard, 193.72 feet, along a curve deflecting to the right, having a radius of 2530.00 feet, a central angle of 04&#176;23'14" and a chord bearing N 32&#176;17'58" W, 193.67 feet, to the point of beginning; said described tract containing 26,858 Square Feet, 0.6166 Acres.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-49196" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-49196"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 859-2019. Passed 7-24-19, eff. 7-26-19)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29415" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29415" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29415"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.12" id="JD_559.12" title="559.12"></a>&#167; 559.12  Hungarian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29416" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29416"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive, which is also the southeasterly corner of the German Garden; thence southerly along the easterly line of the upper drive 245.85 feet to an iron pipe in the northeasterly corner of the Shakespeare Garden Theater; thence westerly along the northerly line of the Shakespeare Garden Theater 326.30 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 248.20 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the German Garden, thence easterly along the southerly line of the German Garden 359.70 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29417" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29417"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29418" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29418" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29418"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.13" id="JD_559.13" title="559.13"></a>&#167; 559.13  Shakespeare Garden and Bruot Gate and Walk</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29419" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29419"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;(a)&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Shakespeare Garden.</span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;"> That portion of Rockefeller Parkway lying east of the upper drive, between North Blvd. and East 98th Street shall be designated the Shakespeare Garden.</span></div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29420" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29420"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;(b)&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;">Bruot Gate and Walk.</span><span style="font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;"> Beginning at a point in the westerly line of the upper drive at its point of intersection with the westerly prolongation of the main axis of the Shakespeare Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 35 feet to a point; thence westerly by a line which is parallel with said westerly prolongation of the main axis of the Shakespeare Garden and 35.00 feet southerly by rectangular measurement therefrom, about 325 feet to the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive about 60 feet to the southwesterly corner of the Hungarian Garden; thence easterly along the southerly line of the Hungarian, (which southerly line is 25 feet northerly by rectangular measurement and parallel to the westerly prolongation of the main axis of the Shakespeare Garden) 326.30 feet to an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive 25.00 feet to the place of beginning.</span></div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29421" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29421"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 1715-09. Passed 5-10-10, eff. 5-20-10)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29422" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29422" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29422"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.14" id="JD_559.14" title="559.14"></a>&#167; 559.14  Croatian Cultural Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29424" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29424"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning in the westerly line of the upper drive also known as East Blvd., at a point located 35.00 feet southerly by rectangular measurement from its point of intersection with the westerly prolongation of the main axis of the Shakespeare Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of said upper drive (East Blvd.) about 121.8 feet to a point; thence westerly 70.00 feet to a point being 65.00 feet perpendicular by rectangular measurement from the northerly line of the Hebrew Garden; thence southerly along said perpendicular line to the northerly line of Hebrew Garden 65.00 feet to a point on said northerly line of the Hebrew Garden; thence westerly along the said northerly line of the Hebrew Garden about 200.39 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive also known as Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive; thence northerly along said easterly line of the lower drive (Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive) 283.3 feet to point located 60.00 feet southerly by rectangular measurement from the southerly line of the Hungarian Garden; thence easterly along said line parallel and distant 60.00 feet southerly with the southerly line of said Hungarian Garden (also 35.00 feet southerly by rectangular measurement and parallel to the westerly prolongation of said main axis of the Shakespeare Garden) about 326.00 feet to said upper drive (East Blvd.) and the principal place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-40194" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-40194"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 1533-12. Passed 12-3-12, eff. 12-6-12)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29425" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29425" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29425"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.15" id="JD_559.15" title="559.15"></a>&#167; 559.15  Hebrew Cultural Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29427" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29427"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at a stone monument at the point of intersection of the center line of East 102nd St. with the center line of Olivet Ave.; thence westerly along the center line of said Olivet Ave. 839.62 feet to a stone monument in the center line of East 99th St.; thence northerly along the center line of said East 99th St. 18.00 feet to a point; thence westerly at right angles to the center line of East 99th St. 332.11 feet to a point; thence northwesterly on a line deflecting to the right 59 degrees 08 minutes 30 seconds, 351.08 feet to an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive (East Blvd.), which point is the principal place of beginning and is also the northeasterly corner of the Syrian Garden; thence westerly along the northerly line of the Syrian Garden 276.50 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive (Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive); thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive (Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive) 358.00 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the Croatian Garden; thence easterly along the southerly line of the Croatian Garden 200.39 feet to a point; thence northerly perpendicular to the southerly line of the Croatian Garden 65 feet to a point; thence easterly along a line parallel to the southerly line of the Croatian Garden about 70 feet to the westerly line of the upper drive (East Blvd.); thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive (East Blvd.) about 398.20 feet to the principal place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-40195" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-40195"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 1533-12. Passed 12-3-12, eff. 12-6-12)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29428" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29428" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29428"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.16" id="JD_559.16" title="559.16"></a>&#167; 559.16  Syrian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29429" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29429"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive which is also the southeasterly corner of the Hebrew Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive on the arc of a circle deflecting to the right 130.5 feet to an iron pipe in the northeasterly corner of the American Colonial Garden; said arc is subtended by a chord of 129.63 feet; thence on a line deflecting to the right 126 degrees 30 minutes 00 seconds from a chord of said arc produced 104.00 feet to an angle point; thence on a line deflecting to the left 71 degrees 48 minutes 00 seconds, 225.80 feet to an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive 216.56 feet to an iron pipe in the southwesterly corner of the Hebrew Garden, thence easterly along the southerly line of the Hebrew Garden 276.50 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29430" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29430"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29431" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29431" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29431"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.17" id="JD_559.17" title="559.17"></a>&#167; 559.17  American Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29432" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29432"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the westerly line of the upper drive which is also the southeasterly corner of the Syrian Garden; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive about 763.00 feet to a point in the northeasterly line of the park drive connecting the upper and lower drives; thence northwesterly along the northeasterly line of the so- called connecting park drive about 425.00 feet to a point in the easterly line of the lower drive; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive about 208.00 feet to a point in the southwesterly corner of the Syrian Garden; thence northeasterly along the southeasterly line of the Syrian Garden 225.80 feet to an angle point; thence southeasterly along the southwesterly line of the Syrian Garden 104.00 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29433" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29433"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 410-11. Passed 6-6-11, eff. 6-13-11)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29434" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29434" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29434"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.18" id="JD_559.18" title="559.18"></a>&#167; 559.18  Irish Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29435" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29435"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at a point in the easterly line of the lower drive at its point of intersection with the northerly line of Superior Ave.; thence northerly along the easterly line of the lower drive about 665.00 feet to a point in the southwesterly line of the park drive connecting the lower and upper drives; thence southeasterly along the southwesterly line of the so- called connecting park drive about 425.00 feet to a point in the westerly line of the upper drive; thence southerly along the westerly line of the upper drive and East 99th St. about 350.00 feet to the northerly line of Superior Ave.; thence westerly along the northerly line of Superior Ave. about 75.00 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29436" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29436"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29437" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29437" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29437"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.19" id="JD_559.19" title="559.19"></a>&#167; 559.19  Peace Garden of the Nations</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29439" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29439"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;All of that portion of Rockefeller Park between East 99th St. and the upper boulevard and extending northerly to the extension westerly of the northerly line of Tanner Ave., and all that portion of Rockefeller Parkway that lies north of Superior Ave. between East 99th and East 102nd St.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-45455" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-45455"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 706-16. Passed 7-13-16, eff. 7-17-16)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29440" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29440" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29440"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.20" id="JD_559.20" title="559.20"></a>&#167; 559.20  Ukranian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29441" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29441"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive which is the northwesterly corner of the Lithuanian Garden; thence westerly along the westerly prolongation of the northerly line of said Lithuanian Garden 42.00 feet to an iron pipe in the westerly line of said lower drive which is the principal place of beginning; thence northerly along the westerly line of the lower drive on the arc of a circle deflecting to the left 202.00 feet to an iron pipe; said arc of a circle is subtended by a chord measuring 201.26 feet; thence westerly on a line deflecting to the left 86 degrees 03 minutes 00 seconds with the chord of said last described course, produced 86.12 feet to an iron pipe at the top of the east bank of Doan Creek; thence southerly along the top of the east bank of said Doan Creek about 365.00 feet to an iron pipe in the northerly line of a park drive; thence easterly along the northerly line of said park drive and the westerly line of the lower drive about 180.00 feet to the principal place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29442" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29442"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29443" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29443" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29443"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.21" id="JD_559.21" title="559.21"></a>&#167; 559.21  Finnish Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29444" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29444"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pipe in the easterly line of the lower drive which is the northwesterly corner of the Syrian Garden; thence westerly by rectangular measurement with the chord of the westerly curved line of said Syrian Garden, 42.75 feet to an iron pipe on the westerly side of said lower drive; thence northerly along a line deflecting to the right 88 degrees 35 minutes 00 seconds with the westerly prolongation of said last described course, 122.00 feet to an iron pipe, which point is the principal place of beginning, said iron pipe being 0.80 feet westerly from a drill hole set in the westerly curb of said lower drive; thence westerly by rectangular measurement 82.00 feet to an iron pipe at the top of the bank; thence northerly by rectangular measurement 50.00 feet to an iron pipe at the top of the bank; thence continuing northerly making an inside angle of 177 degrees 38 minutes 00 seconds with said last described course 50.15 feet to an iron pipe at the top of the bank; thence easterly making an inside angle of 92 degrees 22 minutes 00 seconds with said last described course 82.00 feet to an iron pipe; that is 1.30 feet westerly from a drill hole set in the westerly curb of the aforesaid lower drive; thence southerly making an inside angle of 87 degrees 38 minutes 00 seconds with said last described course 50.00 feet to an iron pipe, that is 1.00 feet westerly from a drill hole set in the westerly curb of the aforesaid lower drive; thence continuing southerly making an inside angle of 182 degrees 22 minutes 00 seconds with said last described course 50.00 feet to the principal place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29445" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29445"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 109-56. Passed 2-11-57, eff. 2-13-57)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29446" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29446" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29446"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.22" id="JD_559.22" title="559.22"></a>&#167; 559.22  Estonian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29447" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29447"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at an iron pin in the westerly line of Liberty Blvd. which is at the northeasterly corner of the Finnish Garden, said pin being 1.30 feet westerly from a drill hole set in the westerly concrete curb of said Liberty Blvd.; thence northerly making an inside angle of 94 degrees, 12 minutes, 00 seconds with the northerly line of said Finnish Garden, 115.00 feet to an iron pin that is 1.30 feet westerly from a drill hole set in the aforesaid westerly concrete curb line; thence continuing northerly making an inside angle with said last described course 182 degrees, 00 minutes, 00 seconds, 115.00 feet to an iron pin that is 2.00 feet westerly from a drill hole set in said westerly concrete curb; thence westerly making an inside angle of 110 degrees, 00 minutes, 00 seconds with said last described course 57.00 feet to an iron pin that is about 10.00 feet easterly from the easterly retaining wall of Doan Creek; thence southerly and being parallel with said retaining wall about 275.00 feet to an iron pin in the direct westerly prolongation of the aforesaid northerly line of the Finnish Garden; thence easterly along said prolongation and the northerly line of the Finnish Garden 133.00 feet to the place of beginning.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29448" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29448"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 2342-59. Passed 11-23-59, eff. 11-24-59)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29449" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29449" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29449"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.23" id="JD_559.23" title="559.23"></a>&#167; 559.23  Romanian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29450" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29450"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Bounded northwesterly by the southeasterly line of St. Clair Ave., N.E.; bounded easterly by the westerly line of Liberty Blvd. and bounded southwesterly by the northeasterly line of the Park Ramp leading from Liberty Blvd. to St. Clair Ave., N.E.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29451" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29451"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 1130-64. Passed 6-22-64, eff. 6-24-64)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29452" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29452" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29452"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.231" id="JD_559.231" title="559.231"></a>&#167; 559.231  African-American Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29453" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29453"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Situated in Cleveland, and being parts of Original 100 Acre Lot Nos. 367 and 375 and together bounded and described as follows:</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29454" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29454"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Bounded on the north by the southerly line of the ramp leading to St. Clair Avenue N.E. from Liberty Boulevard; bounded on the west by the easterly line of Wheelock Road N.E.; bounded on the south by a line parallel with and being south 1,000 feet equidistant from the southerly line of St. Clair Avenue N.E. and bounded on the east by the westerly curb line of Liberty Boulevard and containing approximately 4 acres of land.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29455" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29455"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 1548-A-76. Passed 8-1-77, eff. 8-2-77)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29456" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29456" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29456"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.232" id="JD_559.232" title="559.232"></a>&#167; 559.232  India Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29457" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29457"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Bounded northerly by the southerly line of the Finnish Garden; bounded easterly by the westerly line of Liberty Boulevard; bounded southerly by a line that is parallel and 200.00 feet southerly measured at right angles from said southerly line of the Finnish Garden and bounded westerly by a line that is 10.00 feet easterly and parallel with the easterly stone wall of Doan Creek.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29458" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29458"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 2148-80. Passed 12-15-80, eff. 12-17-80)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29459" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29459" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29459"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.233" id="JD_559.233" title="559.233"></a>&#167; 559.233  Chinese Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29460" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29460"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Situated in the City of Cleveland, County of Cuyahoga and State of Ohio and known as being a part of Original 100 Acre Lot No. 402 and bounded and described as follows:</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29461" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29461"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at a stone monument marking the intersection of the centerline of East 105th Street, 60 feet wide, with the centerline of Park Lane N.E., 30 feet wide; thence due north 280.00 feet along said centerline of East 105th Street to a point; thence due east 250.00 feet to a point for the principal place of beginning of the premises herein intended to be described; thence continuing due east about 57.70 feet to the intersection with the southwesterly edge of a bituminous concrete sidewalk; thence southeasterly about 184.00 feet following said southwesterly edge of the bituminous sidewalk to its intersection with a line parallel to and distant southerly 125.00 feet, at right angles, from the 3rd course above; thence due west about 192.00 feet; thence due north 125.00 feet to the principal place of beginning, be the same more or less, but subject to all legal highways.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29462" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29462"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;The bearings used in the above description are to an assumed meridian and are used to indicate directions.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29463" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29463"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 311-85. Passed 4-1-85, eff. 4-2-85)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29464" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29464" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29464"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.234" id="JD_559.234" title="559.234"></a>&#167; 559.234  Lebanese Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29470" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29470"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning in the westerly line of Martin Luther King Jr. Dr. (formerly Liberty Boulevard), at the south-easterly corner of the India Garden (Section <Link class="Jump" to="{{ pathname: '/codes/cleveland/latest/cleveland_oh/0-0-0-29456', hash: '#JD_559.232' }}">559.232</Link>), and the principle place of beginning;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-42101" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-42101"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence southwesterly, along the southeasterly line of said India Garden, and its prolongation approximately 129.50 feet to the easterly line of Doan Brook;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-42100" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-42100"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence southeasterly, along said easterly line of Doan Brook, approximately 276.36 feet to a point;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-42099" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-42099"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence northeasterly, along a line parallel to the aforementioned southeasterly line of the India Garden, approximately 141.55 feet to a point in the aforementioned westerly line of Martin Luther King Jr. Dr.;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-42098" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-42098"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence northwesterly, along said westerly line of Martin Luther King Jr. Dr., approximately 272.68 feet, to the aforementioned southeasterly line of the India Garden and the principle place of beginning, containing 36,758 sq. ft., 0.8438 acres, be the same more or less but subject to all legal highways.</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-42097" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-42097"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(Ord. No. 407-15. Passed 6-1-15, eff. 6-2-15)</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div class="clearfix"></div></div>
<div><span depth="6"></span><CodeOptions destID="rid-0-0-0-29471" class="Section"></CodeOptions><div id="rid-0-0-0-29471" class="Section toc-destination rbox" style="margin-top: .5rem"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29471"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name="JD_559.235" id="JD_559.235" title="559.235"></a>&#167; 559.235  Latvian Garden</h6></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29472" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29472"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;0.6036 Acres</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29473" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29473"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Situated in the City of Cleveland, County of Cuyahoga and State of Ohio and known as being part of Original 100 Acre Lot No. 367 of East Cleveland Township, and also contained within Section &#8220;A&#8221;. Brookway Division of Rockefeller Park, and bounded and described as follows:</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29474" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29474"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Beginning at the intersection of St. Clair Street, N.E., 80 feet wide, with the East line of said Original 100 Acre Lot No. 367, a 5/8" iron pin monument box found and used;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29475" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29475"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence South 58&#176; 43' 50" West, along the centerline of said St. Clair Street, N.E. a distance of 744.20 feet to the centerline intersection of Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive, a private road within said Rockefeller Park, which point of intersection is in the centerline of a bridge over passing said Martin Luther King Drive;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29476" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29476"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence South 32&#176; 14' 33" East, along the centerline of said Dr. Martin Luther King. Jr. Drive, a distance of 90.09 feet to a point of curvature;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29477" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29477"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence along the centerline of said Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive, along a curve deflecting to the right, having a radius of 1350.00 feet, a central angle of 27&#176; 35' 12", an arc of 650.00 feet, a chord of 643.74 feet, which bears South 18&#176; 26' 56" East to a point of tangency;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29478" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29478"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence South 4&#176; 39' 20" East, along the centerline of said Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive, a distance of 180.00 feet to a point of curvature;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29479" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29479"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence along the centerline of said Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive, along a curve deflecting to the left, having a radius of 1200.00 feet, a central angle of 33&#176; 25' 21", an arc of 700.00 feet, a chord of 690.12 feet, which bears South 21&#176; 22' 01" East to a point of tangency;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29480" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29480"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence South 38&#176; 04' 41" East, along the centerline of said Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr. Drive, a distance of 200.00 feet to a point of curvature;</div></div><div class="clearfix"></div><div id="rid-0-0-0-29481" class="rbox Normal-Level"><AnnotationDrawer recordId="0-0-0-29481"></AnnotationDrawer><div>&#160;&#160;&#160;Thence along the centerline of said Dr. Martin Luther King. Jr. Drive, along a curve de